---
---
<form class="grid gap-4 rounded-2xl border border-brand-100 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm" method="POST">
  <div class="grid gap-1">
    <label for="name" class="text-sm font-medium text-brand-900">Name</label>
    <input
      id="name"
      name="name"
      type="text"
      required
      class="rounded-lg border border-brand-200 px-3 py-2 text-sm focus:border-brand-500 focus:outline-none focus:ring-1 focus:ring-brand-500"
    />
  </div>

  <div class="grid gap-1">
    <label for="email" class="text-sm font-medium text-brand-900">E-Mail</label>
    <input
      id="email"
      name="email"
      type="email"
      required
      class="rounded-lg border border-brand-200 px-3 py-2 text-sm focus:border-brand-500 focus:outline-none focus:ring-1 focus:ring-brand-500"
    />
  </div>

  <div class="grid gap-1">
    <label for="phone" class="text-sm font-medium text-brand-900">Telefon (optional)</label>
    <input
      id="phone"
      name="phone"
      type="tel"
      class="rounded-lg border border-brand-200 px-3 py-2 text-sm focus:border-brand-500 focus:outline-none focus:ring-1 focus:ring-brand-500"
    />
  </div>

  <div class="grid gap-1">
    <label for="message" class="text-sm font-medium text-brand-900">Nachricht</label>
    <textarea
      id="message"
      name="message"
      rows="4"
      required
      class="rounded-lg border border-brand-200 px-3 py-2 text-sm focus:border-brand-500 focus:outline-none focus:ring-1 focus:ring-brand-500"
    ></textarea>
  </div>

  <button
    type="submit"
    class="justify-self-start rounded-full bg-brand-600 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white hover:bg-brand-700"
  >
    Nachricht senden
  </button>

  <p class="text-xs text-brand-900/50">
    Hinweis: Dieses Formular ist aktuell reine Oberfläche. Die Anbindung an ein
    Backend (z. B. Cloudflare Pages Function + E-Mail-Versand) folgt in einem
    späteren Schritt.
  </p>
</form>
